- **Feature Flags Initiative:** Driving adoption of trunk-based development with feature flags across 12-person team. Authored comprehensive RFC proposing shift from current branching strategy to trunk-based development using `develop` as single source of truth.
  - **Problems Solved:** Work stagnation ("hanging cards"), environment scarcity bottlenecks, protracted deployment cycles, high-cost reversions
  - **Strategy:** Code merged to `develop` immediately after review, features encapsulated in disabled flags, deployed dormant to production, activated via configuration change
